+To work from a source checkout instead, install the clone with pip:
+
+```bash
+git clone https://github.com/aspose-psd-foss/Aspose.PSD-FOSS-for-Python.git
+cd Aspose.PSD-FOSS-for-Python
+pip install .
+```
